                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fab5269a-dee1-452b-9811-a3dac561cab9",
                                "sense_id": "3547b044-f041-36be-8a5c-2c8f7ecbdf06",
                                "text": "Ах, не холоде́ет, не холоде́ет ещё мир. […] Горячность — су́щность его́, любо́вь есть су́щность его́.\n[…] И пы́шущие щеки́. И пе́рси ми́ра. И та́йны ло́на его́.\nИ ма́ленький Розанов, где́-то заку́тавшийся в его́ пе́рсях.",
                                "translation": "Ah, the world has not yet grown cold. […] Vehemence—the essence of it, love is its essence.\n[…] And the bursting cheeks. And the bosom of the world. And the secrets of its heart.\nAnd little Rozanov, somewhere wrapped up in its bosom.",
                                "english": "Ah, the world has not yet grown cold. […] Vehemence—the essence of it, love is its essence.\n[…] And the bursting cheeks. And the bosom of the world. And the secrets of its heart.\nAnd little Rozanov, somewhere wrapped up in its bosom."
                            }
                        ]
